        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4718, Traditional Fancy Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fancy Ribbed Appliance Pull comes packaged with all the necessary hardware to mount on most big household appliances. However, this pull can be used in any through-bolt mounting application including on front doors. RK International's AP-PH-4718 Traditional Fancy Refrigerator Pull has a 12 inch center to center and a 12-3/4 inch overall length. Choose from on of the 5 available finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-drop-pull-rk-international-cp-3721\"><b>Fancy Ridged Drop Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/fancy-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3718\"><b>Fancy Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9308\"><b>Fancy Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4718 Fancy Appliance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
